1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,680
I can't believe that he said this on live TV.

2
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:08,260
The combined wealth, this is according to Oxfam, of the world's 85 richest people

3
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:12,620
is equal to the 3.5 billion poorest people.

4
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:13,640
It's fantastic.

5
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:16,800
And this is a great thing because it inspires everybody,

6
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:19,700
gets the motivation to look up to the 1% and say,

7
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:21,040
I want to become one of those people.

8
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:22,780
I'm going to fight hard to get up to the top.

9
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:24,460
This is fantastic news.

10
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:25,640
And of course I applaud it.

11
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:28,560
What can be wrong with this?

12
